  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/05/IMG_7395.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>A la imatge principal, l&#39;&uacute;ltim acte de la 33&ordf; Fira del Llibre d&#39;Onda, la presentaci&oacute; del llibre Mem&ograve;ries d&#39;un Roder, d&#39;Ernest Nab&agrave;s Orenga, a c&agrave;rrec de l&#39;autor, d&#39;Enrique Navarro Andreu, ex-alcalde, i de Nadal Escrig Gonz&aacute;lez, director del diari eltriangulo.es.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/05/IMG_7397.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El principi de la presentaci&oacute; ha coincidit amb una forta tormenta, que ha marcat el final de certamen.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtediumengefirallibreonda/img_6582.jpg\" alt=\"img_6582\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtediumengefirallibreonda/img_6584.jpg\" alt=\"img_6584\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtediumengefirallibreonda/img_6585.jpg\" alt=\"img_6585\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtediumengefirallibreonda/img_6587.jpg\" alt=\"img_6587\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtediumengefirallibreonda/img_6588.jpg\" alt=\"img_6588\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtediumengefirallibreonda/img_6590.jpg\" alt=\"img_6590\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabtediumengefirallibreonda/img_6593.jpg\" alt=\"img_6593\" style=\"max-width:100%;heig